          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#BunkeNikolausVoelkl13"} Bunke-Nikolaus-Völkl 13, (9), (10)
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stokes+theorem"} Stokes theorem
              holds:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mo ∫
